+/**
+ * Melox extension: an expandable [NavigationRail] with explicit content-top [statusBarInsets].
+ *
+ * These insets apply only to the inner scroll column when [defaultWindowInsetsPadding] is true.
+ * Optional [contentBottomInsets] reserve a clipped viewport above an overlapping surface.
+ * These bottom insets are consumed before scrolling to avoid duplicate navigation-bar spacing.
+ * The rail background, divider, start cutout and navigation-bar insets retain their native bounds.
+ * The overload without [statusBarInsets] continues to use [WindowInsets.statusBars].
+ */
