+
+## Stable Content-top Insets
+
+The stateful overload also accepts explicit `statusBarInsets`, applied only to the inner content column when `defaultWindowInsetsPadding` is enabled. The existing overload retains its original behavior. The background, divider and other system insets are unchanged. With the Compose experimental layout API opt-in, retain space while the status bar is hidden:
+
+```kotlin
+NavigationRail(
+    state = railState,
+    statusBarInsets = WindowInsets.statusBarsIgnoringVisibility,
+) {
+    // NavigationRailItem content
+}
+```
